# Controls what `gcloud builds submit` uploads as the build context.
# Keep source; drop deps, build outputs, VCS and secrets (rebuilt in-image).
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.nx
**/.nx/cache
.env
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
images
tmp
**/*.log
coverage
**/coverage
playwright-report
**/playwright-report
test-results
**/test-results
